Package: RainAttr
Title: Attribution and Sample Average Treatment Effect for Rainfall Enhancement Trial Data
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-11-09
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Zhi Yang", "Tho", , "tzhiyang1995@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Raymond", "Chambers", , "Raymond.Chambers@anu.edu.au", role = "aut"),
      person("A. H.", "Welsh", , "Alan.Welsh@anu.edu.au", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides tools for estimating rainfall attribution and the sample average treatment effect in rainfall enhancement trials using a two-stage linear mixed model approach. Includes bias-adjusted attribution estimators, bootstrap confidence intervals and p-values, and permutation p-values based on permuting the ionizer operation schedule. Also provides tools for exploratory data analysis and model diagnostics.
